ogram-hint\" class=\"ops-input flow-input\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" type=\"text\" name=\"program\" value=\"reception-ride-home\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\"><p id=\"_R_2rmatpesnfknelb_-program-hint\" class=\"flow-hint\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">The pool guests claim from. “reception-ride-home” unless you run more than one.</span></p></div></div></section></div><footer class=\"flow-foot\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\" data-bl-k=\"footer\"><span></span><div class=\"flow-foot__nav\"><button type=\"submit\" class=\"ops-button ops-button-primary\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-dark=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Continue</span></button></div></footer></form></dialog></div></section><details class=\"flow-details\" data-bl-b=\"\"><summary><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Technical details</span></summary><div class=\"flow-details__body\"><p class=\"con-note\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Provider: </span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">mock</span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\"> (</span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">mock</span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">). The rows as saved, for troubleshooting; nothing here needs changing by hand.</span></p><p class=\"con-caption con-caption--standalone\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Ride benefits, as saved</span></p><p class=\"con-empty-note\" role=\"status\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">None saved.</span></p></div></details></main><!--$--><!--/$--></div>"
